TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="src/test/**"

TEST_COMMAND:
- ./gradlew test
- ./gradlew test --info for verbose output

TEST_CONVENTIONS:
- JUnit 5 or Kotest (pick one, be consistent)
- MockK for mocking Kotlin classes
- Test class: FooTest, functions: `fun `descriptive test name`()`
- Use @DisplayName for human-readable test names in JUnit 5

COVERAGE_REQUIREMENTS:
- (fill in — e.g., "JaCoCo threshold set in build.gradle.kts")

FORBIDDEN_IN_TESTS:
- No real I/O without mocking
- No runBlocking at test root — use runTest (kotlinx-coroutines-test)
- No @Disabled without a comment and tracking issue
